Package: ten64-controller
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: utility for the Traverse Ten64 board microcontroller
 Command-line tool to talk to the LPC804 board-management microcontroller on the
 Traverse Ten64 ARM64 router over I2C (/dev/i2c-0, address 0x7E). It reads the
 microcontroller firmware version and serial number, the system control state
 (ATX power, current/next boot source, reset-button behaviour), inspects the two
 firmware image banks, and can install new microcontroller firmware.
 .
 The package ships a modules-load.d snippet that loads i2c-dev so /dev/i2c-0 is
 present. It is specific to Ten64 hardware (arm64).
